services=[('websites','01','Build.','Websites that convert','A website that looks like the next version of your business.','We turn unclear offers and outdated pages into digital experiences that feel credible, memorable, and easy to act on.',['Positioning and page structure','Wireframes and visual direction','Responsive design and development','CMS setup and practical handover','Content and on-page SEO guidance','Analytics, speed and launch checks'],'For businesses that have outgrown their website.','Your website should make the right next step feel obvious.'),('automation','02','Automate.','Automation that keeps moving','Make the follow-up happen before the lead goes cold.','Practical GoHighLevel systems for lead capture, nurturing, bookings and reporting, connected to how your team actually works.',['CRM and pipeline setup','Lead capture and routing','Email and SMS follow-up','Forms, funnels and booking flows','Integrations with existing tools','Team training and optimisation'],'For teams losing time to disconnected tools.','Automate the repeatable. Keep the human part human.'),('social','03','Dominate.','Content that earns attention','A content engine for brands with something to say.','Turn scattered ideas into a repeatable content system: strategy, creative, publishing and insight working together.',['Content strategy and pillars','Monthly content planning','Reels and short-form video','Graphics, carousels and captions','Scheduling and community guidance','Reporting and performance reviews'],'For brands ready to show up with a point of view.','Less posting for the sake of it. More to say.')]
